### 19 TAC 89.1085 - Extended School Year Services (ESY)

(a) Each school district shall ensure that ESY services are available as necessary to provide FAPE.
(b) The need for ESY services must be determined on an individual basis by the ARD committee.
(c) In determining the need for ESY services, the ARD committee shall consider:
(1) regression and recoupment data;
(2) the degree of progress toward IEP goals;
(3) emerging skills or breakthrough opportunities;
(4) interfering behaviors;
(5) the nature and severity of the disability;
(6) special circumstances.
(d) A school district may not:
(1) limit ESY services to particular categories of disability; or
(2) unilaterally limit the type, amount, or duration of ESY services.
